Unit proof: get_base_name's contract (no separator in the result; the
result is exactly the tail after the last '/'; the stripped stem is a
prefix of the base name) proven over ALL printable strings up to
length 4 via nondeterministic characters.  Exercises std::string
rfind/substr on the extern-instantiated basic_string<char>, whose
out-of-line .tcc bodies the front end now instantiates.
